]During a news conference on Tuesday, investigating officer Brig. Gen. Bruce Oliveira shared details of the state’s probe and said when the mistake was realized, the employee “froze” and “seemed confused.”[ Another] employee had to resume his[ duties] and send a[ correction] message[,] Olive[ira] said[.
